00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.810
This is my wife, my
daughter, and myself.

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.780
And earlier in the year,
we were in New York City.

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:50.230
This is just a
couple of months ago.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:50.990
