was the Statue of Liberty.

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:07.013
You can access this yourself
if you're a developer,

00:10:07.013 --> 00:10:08.680
and you don't want
to just drag and drop

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:11.420
an image into the web UI.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.690
This is the JSON request
that you can just hit

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.990
