00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:18.490
And this is the response
that you can get.

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.210
Why does that matter?

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.780
Well, the really cool part is
if you didn't want to just do

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:26.290
one photo at a time,
what you can do

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:28.690
is that you can actually
send a batch request

