likely inside of these photos.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.310
And it's BigQuery to
store all of that data

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:01.487
and allow us to query it.

00:11:01.487 --> 00:11:03.820
You don't really have to worry
about too much of the SQL

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:04.695
