was wearing the hat,

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.240
or if it was a
particular landmark,

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.740
or if there's
likelihood of surprise,

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:29.800
you get that response, and you
can query those 200,000 images

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:31.490
to do some really cool things.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:34.420
So this query inside
of BigQuery says,

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.660
