00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:40.870
And as you saw where was
the highlighted squares,

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:45.430
the shades of green, you can see
it was very likely to likely.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.070
In this section of code,
what this does is this shows,

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:53.680
find me the image where
surprise is most likely

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.810
from just an image of artwork.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.400
These are literally just
photos, and the machine says,

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.840
I think this piece of
art looks surprised.

